<%#
  Rendered with layout: false, and styled inline rather than through the asset
  pipeline. This page's whole job is to report that a variable is missing, and
  it has to render even when something upstream of the layout or the assets is
  unhappy.
%><!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Spool — authentication misconfigured</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
      body {
        margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center;
        justify-content: center; padding: 2rem 1rem; background: #f9fafb;
        color: #111827; line-height: 1.5;
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      }
      .card {
        max-width: 34rem; width: 100%; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        border-radius: 0.5rem; padding: 1.5rem;
      }
      h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
      p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; font-size: 0.925rem; }
      ul { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
      li { font-size: 0.925rem; }
      code {
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
        font-size: 0.85em; background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 0.25rem;
        padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
      }
      .muted { color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.825rem; }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body { background: #030712; color: #f3f4f6; }
        .card { background: #111827; border-color: #1f2937; }
        code { background: #1f2937; }
        .muted { color: #9ca3af; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Authentication is half-configured</h1>

      <p>
        Spool found some OpenID Connect settings but not all of them, so it can't tell
        whether this instance is meant to be open or protected. Rather than guess and
        serve a helpdesk unauthenticated, it is refusing to serve at all.
      </p>

      <p>Set the missing variables and restart:</p>
      <ul>
        <% SpoolAuthorization.missing_oidc_vars.each do |var| %>
          <li><code><%= var %></code></li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>

      <p class="muted">
        To run open — development only; Spool refuses to boot open in production —
        unset <em>all</em> of
        <code><%= SpoolAuthorization::OIDC_VARS.join("</code>, <code>").html_safe %></code>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
